# Patterns without **/ match only the build-context root — keep the prefixes.
# .env must NEVER reach the build context (the API key would be baked into a layer).
**/.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/logs
frontend/dist
build
*.vcd
**/.pytest_cache
